WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
We dug it in easily at first. It was very simple.

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,130
Bad timing

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:08,170
When did we dig up the earth?

4
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:09,450
It just snowed not long ago

5
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:10,650
It's not cold enough to the bone

6
00:00:10,770 --> 00:00:12,530
The moisture in the land at that time

7
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:13,650
Haven't been completely penetrated yet

8
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:15,930
If the hole in the upper layer is hard, you can dig it down.

9
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,490
The mud underneath is still soft and sticky, remember?

10
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:23,700
Even though you worked hard back then, you were able to dig a hole. But now, these days

11
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,460
One hunger and cold blizzard after another

12
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,620
Such a long period of cold weather

13
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,100
Plus those few sheets of thick hard snow

14
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,900
Pour cold into the ground day and night

15
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:35,420
A portion that had been completely penetrated long ago turned into a shocking piece.

16
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:44,010
The hard and solid cave soil Muchuan

17
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:45,010
I'm here

18
00:00:45,010 --> 00:00:46,610
Why don't you come out quickly to greet me?

19
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:48,950
Mr. Sun brought so many people with him

20
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:51,710
What are you doing for my house?
